{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1535926-when-to-use-spirit","id":1535926,"title":"When to use Spirit?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-19T15:50:28-07:00","id":1535926,"title":"When to use Spirit?","content":"I'm running a game that will include a huge amount of travel through other worlds. The thing is, some realms seem to work on the rules of the Earth, some even say that spirits must Materialize upon entering. Also, I generally fear that the Spirit Sphere may become too powerful when the game starts to really happens more on other worlds.<br /> <br /> After all, which are the limitations of the Spirit Sphere outside Earth? How do I know when their landscape and inhabitants are made of ephemera?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T16:26:43-07:00","id":1535932,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s largely a judgement call. As a rough guideline I\u2019d say if the realm has its own identity and its own specialized rules it is a good candidate for acting like the physical world or even requiring another set of spheres. If it strongly resonates with a sphere that\u2019s also a good reason to let mages use that sphere imo, even if it\u2019s a spiritual realm. For instance a domain of fire spirits should work with forces.<br /> <br /> If spirits have to use materialize to get in, it\u2019s a certainty mages need more than spirit to manipulate the realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-19T16:36:45-07:00","id":1535935,"title":"","content":"Being in Umbra Realms doesn't mean Spirit gets to do everything. While Spirit inherently gets more useful in an Umbra-hoping game than an Earth-bound one, the Sphere itself doesn't gain additional powers... it's just in a place where it's normal powers have more chances to do thing.<br /> <br /> When a being create an Umbral Realm, they create rules for it: like physics and so on. If the Realm has Earth-like gravity, you can't use Spirit to replace Forces to levitate. In theory, Spirit would (at high levels) let you rewrite the Ream completely, but that's not exactly a fast or immediate thing (or one without resistance). Some Realms have their own biological ecosystems, and the same deal: even though you're in the Umbra, the wildlife of a Realm are Life Patterns.<br /> <br /> In some (well many probably) you might need to add Spirit to Pattern Spheres (much like you need Spirit to mess with a Fera' pattern), but Spirit alone isn't generally going to be enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T00:42:51-07:00","id":1535974,"title":"","content":"Personally i think a bit differently about Spirit. I think it should not &quot;replace other spheres in umbra&quot; or &quot;be more limited in some places&quot;. For me its more about the cost. With spirit you can emulate every other sphere. But you have to ask or force a apropriate spirit to do it for you. That has a cost and is nor easy nor fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28439-quelsec","name":"quelsec","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T01:43:51-07:00","id":1535975,"title":"","content":"Going by the book (both M20 and the frequently cited Book of Worlds) spheres work a little differently in the penumbra<br /> <br /> spirit effects shines bright like a beacon and can affect living spirits like Life and object spirits like Matter, but such effects tend to be as temporary as their material counterparts.<br /> <br /> <br /> they do not replace Forces, cannot affect non spirit Life patterns or Matter patterns (such as those who stepped sideways in to the spirit realm), and cannot be used to affect Minds in any capacity. Spirit is very much limited to affecting other spirits in that regard.<br /> <br /> Beyond the penumbra, Book of Worlds has alternative rules for applications of magic in specific realms within the middle umbra.<br /> <br /> In the High umbra, Mind is far more influential, and while Spirit still affects many things there, it is Mind which tenda to allow passage to greater heights. And in the Dark umbra, Spirit (and Mind) is far more difficult while Entropy is much easier ti employ.<br /> <br /> going off in to the deep umbra requires one to find a anchorhead (a portal and thus is in your control as an ST) or have Spirit 5 to break the dream shell (go beyond the horizon)<br /> <br /> once in the deep umbra all bets are off. Each realm has its own rules and will become more difficult to affect with Spirit alone, if even possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-20T17:34:47-07:00","id":1536016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>quelsec</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1535926-when-to-use-spirit?p=1535974#post1535974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally i think a bit differently about Spirit. I think it should not &quot;replace other spheres in umbra&quot; or &quot;be more limited in some places&quot;. For me its more about the cost. With spirit you can emulate every other sphere. But you have to ask or force a apropriate spirit to do it for you. That has a cost and is nor easy nor fast.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not the point.<br /> <br /> Spirit affects ephemera. My doubt came because in a regular Spirit World everything is made of ephemera. If everything around you is ephemera, Spirit can affect it directly, not through bargaining with spirits.<br /> <br /> But I already got plenty of useful answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}